# No environment configuration is required on Tenten with Node.js 24+.
# PORT is supplied by the hosting service.
# Optional private data location, OUTSIDE the application root:
# HOKI_DATA_DIR=/absolute/private/hoki-cms
# Optional first-admin credentials; omit to generate a random private password.
# ADMIN_USERNAME=admin
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=choose-a-private-password-at-least-12-characters
